WEBVTT

1
00:49:02.666 --> 00:49:06.666
I want to sing one more time with faith.

2
00:49:06.666 --> 00:49:11.666
I want to sing one more time, so we don't just check off the worship.

3
00:49:11.666 --> 00:49:16.666
But I want to sing the chorus one more time, I want to sing that bridge together one more time.

4
00:49:16.666 --> 00:49:18.666
It is not a building that You want to fill.

5
00:49:18.666 --> 00:49:24.666
Shall we stand for a moment, focus on Jesus, close your eyes and sing it one more time.

6
00:49:26.666 --> 00:49:28.666
Come on people, sing it one more time.

7
00:49:29.666 --> 00:49:31.666
Focus on Jesus.

8
00:49:32.666 --> 00:49:35.666
All distractions away in the name of Jesus.

9
00:49:46.666 --> 00:49:50.666
Think about the words you are singing. Come on, sing it with faith.

10
00:49:59.666 --> 00:50:01.666
One more time, one more time.

11
00:50:13.666 --> 00:50:15.666
Yes, praise Your name Jesus.

12
00:50:15.666 --> 00:50:18.666
Repetition people, you have to keep repeating it.

13
00:50:18.666 --> 00:50:20.666
You have to keep singing up to here.

14
00:50:20.666 --> 00:50:23.666
You have to keep saying, Lord, I want to follow You.

15
00:50:23.666 --> 00:50:25.666
Lord, I want to follow You.

16
00:50:25.666 --> 00:50:26.666
Lord, I want to follow You.

17
00:50:26.666 --> 00:50:29.666
Lord, I want to belong to You.

18
00:50:29.666 --> 00:50:31.666
I want to follow You.

19
00:50:31.666 --> 00:50:37.666
You know people, last week, last Sunday I was here at the beginning of the service.

20
00:50:37.666 --> 00:50:40.666
And I was sick, boy, not normal.

21
00:50:40.666 --> 00:50:43.666
And I thought, a few people came up to me, saying hello.

22
00:50:43.666 --> 00:50:45.666
And I thought, go away, you know.

23
00:50:45.666 --> 00:50:47.666
That's how I felt.

24
00:50:47.666 --> 00:50:49.666
And so I did go to the service.

25
00:50:49.666 --> 00:50:51.666
And here is the statement.

26
00:50:51.666 --> 00:50:53.666
I did want to go to the service.

27
00:50:53.666 --> 00:50:55.666
I just wanted to go to the service.

28
00:50:55.666 --> 00:50:58.666
I just want to be with my brothers and sisters in the faith.

29
00:50:58.666 --> 00:50:59.666
I want to worship God.

30
00:50:59.666 --> 00:51:01.666
I want to learn more of His Word.

31
00:51:01.666 --> 00:51:02.666
But physically it just wasn't possible.

32
00:51:02.666 --> 00:51:04.666
So I went, hop, back home.

33
00:51:04.666 --> 00:51:06.666
And now I came back this morning.

34
00:51:06.666 --> 00:51:11.666
And I immediately had that feeling of, wow, how long has it been since I've been in the church.

35
00:51:11.666 --> 00:51:14.666
But that's a good feeling.

36
00:51:14.666 --> 00:51:17.666
Because for myself, let this be a model.

37
00:51:17.666 --> 00:51:22.666
I made an appointment with myself and my family.

38
00:51:22.666 --> 00:51:25.666
We will serve the Lord.

39
00:51:25.666 --> 00:51:30.666
And so for me, being away from the church for a week feels strange.

40
00:51:30.666 --> 00:51:32.666
This doesn't feel good.

41
00:51:32.666 --> 00:51:36.666
I want to fill myself with the sound of collective worship.

42
00:51:36.666 --> 00:51:40.666
I want to fill myself with the sound we just made.

43
00:51:40.666 --> 00:51:43.666
Yes, indeed, the sound we get to make together.

44
00:51:43.666 --> 00:51:48.666
How beautiful and how clean the worship was today, that we could magnify God.

45
00:51:48.666 --> 00:51:52.666
Together, in the united voice that we as a church can create.

46
00:51:52.666 --> 00:51:55.666
That is what I want to fill myself with weekly.

47
00:51:55.666 --> 00:51:58.666
I want to fill myself weekly with God's Word.

48
00:51:58.666 --> 00:52:00.666
Daily filling with God's Word.

49
00:52:00.666 --> 00:52:03.666
So that it will never become estranged in my heart.

50
00:52:03.666 --> 00:52:11.666
For I recognize, just like everyone in this room, that the world and life are full of distractions and diversions.

51
00:52:12.666 --> 00:52:20.666
So to ensure that those distractions do not take over me, I need to pray, however you want to say that.

52
00:52:20.666 --> 00:52:23.666
To ensure that, I must keep repeating.

53
00:52:23.666 --> 00:52:26.666
It is not a building that you want to fill.

54
00:52:26.666 --> 00:52:27.666
It is my heart.

55
00:52:27.666 --> 00:52:29.666
Fill me, fill me, fill me.

56
00:52:29.666 --> 00:52:31.666
Repetition, repetition for the rest of my life.

57
00:52:31.666 --> 00:52:32.666
Amen.

58
00:52:32.666 --> 00:52:33.666
Amen.

59
00:52:33.666 --> 00:52:34.666
You may take a seat for a moment.

60
00:52:34.666 --> 00:52:35.666
Hallelujah.

61
00:52:35.666 --> 00:52:38.666
Can I get a round of applause for the band, for those wonderful people.

62
00:52:42.666 --> 00:52:55.666
Before I start the teaching, I want to give a small testimony as a basis for a collection teaching.

63
00:52:55.666 --> 00:52:59.666
I don't have a Bible verse, but I have a testimony to share with you.

64
00:52:59.666 --> 00:53:05.666
About what happened two weeks ago, or ten days ago, I don't know when it was.

65
00:53:06.666 --> 00:53:14.666
You know that we held a Christmas collection during the Christmas service.

66
00:53:14.666 --> 00:53:21.666
This year, that Christmas collection went to the food bank in Lommel.

67
00:53:21.666 --> 00:53:23.666
Can you still remember that or not?

68
00:53:23.666 --> 00:53:24.666
Yes, right?

69
00:53:24.666 --> 00:53:29.666
We really raised a whopping 6500 euros there.

70
00:53:29.666 --> 00:53:44.666
I keep saying this every time, for the size of the church that we have, that we are together, the family that we are, raising 6500 euros in one collection is a lot of money.

71
00:53:44.666 --> 00:53:52.666
I want us all to be thankful to God for that, that we have this faith, that we do this together.

72
00:53:53.666 --> 00:54:07.666
It's not just that I experience it that way, but also when Bram from the financial team presents figures to various institutions, accountants, agencies, and such companies.

73
00:54:07.666 --> 00:54:12.666
Then it is sometimes said, wow, this is great what you are doing as a church.

74
00:54:12.666 --> 00:54:17.666
So it is also objective. I personally feel proud that we do this as a church.

75
00:54:17.666 --> 00:54:28.666
But it is also objective, other people in the world say, well, that church that does these kinds of amounts, that testifies to something, that testifies to faith.

76
00:54:28.666 --> 00:54:34.666
So I want to thank us as a church enormously for what we can do together in the name of Jesus.

77
00:54:34.666 --> 00:54:46.666
And what I find so cool is that the money we raise at Christmas for the food bank is also a challenge for myself and for us as a church.

78
00:54:46.666 --> 00:54:51.666
Because you know, we could also use that money ourselves, we are saving for a new building.

79
00:54:51.666 --> 00:55:00.666
And then I could better tell Bram, Bram, we are not giving anything to the food bank, we are going to keep it for ourselves, we are going to save it for our building.

80
00:55:00.666 --> 00:55:02.666
But no, that is not how our faith works.

81
00:55:02.666 --> 00:55:15.666
Our faith is such that if we, as the Bible says, take care of the people who are hungry, take care of the widows, take care of the orphans, take care of the single moms who sometimes have to go to the food bank.

82
00:55:15.666 --> 00:55:18.666
Caring for the people in our area, our area.

83
00:55:18.666 --> 00:55:21.666
Then God will always take care of us.

84
00:55:21.666 --> 00:55:25.666
For we have a God in heaven who looks at our behavior.

85
00:55:25.666 --> 00:55:29.666
We do not have a God in heaven who looks at the numbers of people in the room.

86
00:55:29.666 --> 00:55:33.666
We do not have a God in heaven who looks at the revenue of open church.

87
00:55:33.666 --> 00:55:38.666
We do not have a God in heaven, we have a God in heaven who looks at our behavior. Amen.

88
00:55:38.666 --> 00:55:44.666
And that is why I find this super cool, what we raised with the Christmas collection, 6500 euros, something like that.

89
00:55:44.666 --> 00:55:50.666
And we would go buy shopping carts for that.

90
00:55:50.666 --> 00:55:51.666
Do you know them?

91
00:55:51.666 --> 00:55:58.666
The food bank in Lommel, Saint Vincent, is really a great organization.

92
00:55:58.666 --> 00:56:01.666
And Danny Huismans is a great guy.

93
00:56:01.666 --> 00:56:04.666
Really, I recommend everyone to meet him once.

94
00:56:04.666 --> 00:56:05.666
What a driven man.

95
00:56:05.666 --> 00:56:07.666
Truly a man of God that he does this.

96
00:56:08.666 --> 00:56:16.666
But the food bank in Lommel looks like a makeshift soapbox place.

97
00:56:16.666 --> 00:56:18.666
And I say that with all respect.

98
00:56:18.666 --> 00:56:21.666
It is done voluntarily, with voluntary hands.

99
00:56:21.666 --> 00:56:27.666
Not by skilled carpenters who have beautifully put something together.

100
00:56:27.666 --> 00:56:29.666
It doesn't look very nice inside.

101
00:56:29.666 --> 00:56:30.666
And that can be done better.

102
00:56:30.666 --> 00:56:33.666
So as a church, we said, we can do that better.

103
00:56:33.666 --> 00:56:36.666
We are going to ensure that there will be nice shelving units.

104
00:56:37.666 --> 00:56:39.666
And we were going to buy those.

105
00:56:39.666 --> 00:56:43.666
And then I started looking, together with Arjan Prins who is here in the church.

106
00:56:43.666 --> 00:56:45.666
He works at Jumbo Netherlands.

107
00:56:45.666 --> 00:56:51.666
And I said to Arjan, Arjan, can't you make sure that we can buy some shelving units?

108
00:56:51.666 --> 00:56:56.666
For that 6500 euros, can't we buy a few nice shelving units?

109
00:56:56.666 --> 00:56:59.666
And he got some price quotes.

110
00:56:59.666 --> 00:57:02.666
