111
00:57:03.666 --> 00:57:06.666
And with 6500 euros, you might be able to buy one shelf.

112
00:57:06.666 --> 00:57:09.666
Really, that's expensive, man.

113
00:57:09.666 --> 00:57:10.666
That's not normal.

114
00:57:10.666 --> 00:57:13.666
I thought to myself, we should be able to buy quite a bit with that.

115
00:57:13.666 --> 00:57:14.666
Not at all.

116
00:57:14.666 --> 00:57:19.666
That costs tens of thousands upon tens of thousands upon tens of thousands of euros.

117
00:57:19.666 --> 00:57:23.666
So I thought to myself, what a discouraging policy is that again.

118
00:57:23.666 --> 00:57:25.666
What are we supposed to do with that?

119
00:57:26.666 --> 00:57:28.666
And then we continued searching.

120
