And what turns out is that the Jumbo stores also do renovations, of course.

121
00:57:33.666 --> 00:57:36.666
They will do the renovations after a few years.

122
00:57:36.666 --> 00:57:38.666
And then I said, maybe we can make a deal there.

123
00:57:38.666 --> 00:57:43.666
Maybe we can buy some second-hand materials there.

124
00:57:43.666 --> 00:57:49.666
I mean, if new costs tens of thousands, then second-hand might be thousands.

125
00:57:49.666 --> 00:57:51.666
And then maybe we can afford it.

126
00:57:51.666 --> 00:57:54.666
So I was actually going for the second-hand market.

127
00:57:54.666 --> 00:57:55.666
And what happened?

128
00:57:55.666 --> 00:57:59.666
All of a sudden, I got a phone call on a Tuesday, I believe.

129
00:57:59.666 --> 00:58:02.666
And with an email screenshot.

130
00:58:02.666 --> 00:58:08.666
And it was that the Jumbo in Veldhoven city center was going.

131
00:58:08.666 --> 00:58:10.666
Hey, one fan, Gerda.

132
00:58:10.666 --> 00:58:12.666
Veldhoven represent.

133
00:58:13.666 --> 00:58:14.666
Super cool.

134
00:58:14.666 --> 00:58:16.666
But Veldhoven, there lives a light.

135
00:58:16.666 --> 00:58:17.666
Amen.

136
00:58:17.666 --> 00:58:19.666
And her name is Gerda, in the name of Jesus.

137
00:58:20.666 --> 00:58:26.666
And the Jumbo in Veldhoven city center is going to renovate.

138
00:58:26.666 --> 00:58:31.666
