139
00:58:31.666 --> 00:58:33.666
You can have it for free.

140
00:58:33.666 --> 00:58:35.666
That is really amazing.

141
00:58:37.666 --> 00:58:39.666
Nani, shall we do it quickly.

142
00:58:39.666 --> 00:58:43.666
There are 19 photos, so we'll just rush through them with a thing.

143
00:58:43.666 --> 00:58:45.666
That's just a Google photo.

144
00:58:45.666 --> 00:58:47.666
This is not what real life looks like.

145
00:58:47.666 --> 00:58:49.666
Otherwise, it would just look quick.

146
00:58:49.666 --> 00:58:51.666
So this is Jumbo Veldhoven.

147
00:58:51.666 --> 00:58:52.666
Next.

148
00:58:52.666 --> 00:58:54.666
And then we'll just quickly go through those photos.

149
00:58:54.666 --> 00:58:57.666
These are those store displays.

150
00:58:57.666 --> 00:58:59.666
Those are those store fixtures.

151
00:58:59.666 --> 00:59:01.666
These kinds of store fixtures.

152
00:59:01.666 --> 00:59:03.666
And we were just allowed to come and take them.

153
00:59:03.666 --> 00:59:05.666
Come and take them, that's how it went.

154
00:59:05.666 --> 00:59:07.666
So this is...

155
00:59:08.666 --> 00:59:10.666
...ridiculously expensive stuff.

156
00:59:10.666 --> 00:59:12.666
Really not normal.

157
00:59:12.666 --> 00:59:14.666
Do you know what that man said to me?

158
00:59:14.666 --> 00:59:22.666
He said the new store with fewer square meters costs one and a half million just for the fixtures.

159
00:59:22.666 --> 00:59:24.666
Do you know what they do with these fixtures?

160
00:59:24.666 --> 00:59:28.666
They just throw them away in the container.

161
00:59:28.666 --> 00:59:31.666
Of course, a metal price will come from that.

162
00:59:31.666 --> 00:59:33.666
I understand that as well.

163
00:59:33.666 --> 00:59:39.666
But the manager himself said this is pure capital destruction.

164
00:59:39.666 --> 00:59:43.666
Do you know how old these structures are?

165
00:59:43.666 --> 00:59:45.666
Only five years old.

166
00:59:45.666 --> 00:59:47.666
Some don't even have a scratch on them.

167
00:59:47.666 --> 00:59:49.666
And this is what we do in the west.

168
00:59:49.666 --> 00:59:51.666
We take something, we make something.

169
00:59:51.666 --> 00:59:53.666
