170
00:59:53.666 --> 01:00:01.666
To then, listen carefully, continue again with exactly the same structures.

171
01:00:01.666 --> 01:00:03.666
Actually, it is immoral.

172
01:00:03.666 --> 01:00:05.666
Actually, it is not ethically responsible.

173
01:00:05.666 --> 01:00:09.666
Only our western society moves so fast.

174
01:00:09.666 --> 01:00:11.666
Check this out.

175
01:00:11.666 --> 01:00:15.666
Check this out, these are sharp guys from Open Church.

176
