182
01:00:36.666 --> 01:00:40.666
Closed hours are very precious.

183
01:00:40.666 --> 01:00:42.666
So Tim, is it going well?

184
01:00:42.666 --> 01:00:47.666
You have to find a way to bring a few people to pick up that rack.

185
01:00:47.666 --> 01:00:49.666
Because at a certain point you get...

186
01:00:49.666 --> 01:00:52.666
Which day was it then? Was it on a Wednesday or not?

187
01:00:52.666 --> 01:00:54.666
It was on a Thursday, right?

188
01:00:54.666 --> 01:00:55.666
That's how it went.

189
01:00:55.666 --> 01:00:58.666
That store closes on Thursday afternoon at two o'clock.

190
01:00:58.666 --> 01:01:02.666
