192
01:01:07.666 --> 01:01:11.666
You have one time slot where you can come in with your guys.

193
01:01:11.666 --> 01:01:13.666
And after that, you have to make sure you are gone.

194
01:01:13.666 --> 01:01:15.666
You must not get in anyone's way.

195
01:01:15.666 --> 01:01:17.666
You must not delay any entrepreneurs.

196
01:01:17.666 --> 01:01:19.666
Because time is money.

197
01:01:19.666 --> 01:01:20.666
Everything is fast.

198
01:01:20.666 --> 01:01:25.666
We live in a wealthy, but absolutely fast-paced society.

199
01:01:25.666 --> 01:01:27.666
So that was the challenge.

200
01:01:27.666 --> 01:01:32.666
Tim, will it work to pick up those store displays with as many people as possible?

201
01:01:32.666 --> 01:01:34.666
I say, hey dude, hold my beer.

202
01:01:34.666 --> 01:01:38.666
So I say, calling the real man of Open Church.

203
01:01:38.666 --> 01:01:41.666
