204
01:01:41.666 --> 01:01:44.666
But these are also the challenges we can handle as a church.

205
01:01:44.666 --> 01:01:46.666
And we flew in there.

206
01:01:46.666 --> 01:01:48.666
Fifteen people showed up.

207
01:01:48.666 --> 01:01:51.666
Mark, please give a round of applause for these heroes.

208
01:01:55.666 --> 01:01:57.666
Really super cool.

209
01:01:57.666 --> 01:01:59.666
Really super cool.

210
01:01:59.666 --> 01:02:02.666
And Filip in our church, he works.

