01:02:41.666 --> 01:02:43.666
That's quite an insane person, isn't it?

224
01:02:43.666 --> 01:02:45.666
What a miracle.

225
01:02:45.666 --> 01:02:47.666
What a provision.

226
01:02:47.666 --> 01:02:50.666
What a blessing that we can do this in the name of Jesus.

227
01:02:50.666 --> 01:02:52.666
Really, I love it.

