and made David, the son of Jesse, king instead of Saul.

1231
02:01:15.666 --> 02:01:20.666
God helped Saul out of life.

1232
02:01:20.666 --> 02:01:21.666
What?

1233
02:01:22.666 --> 02:01:26.666
This is not the life-giving God that I thought we were so happy about,

1234
02:01:26.666 --> 02:01:28.666
hallelujah tambourine.

1235
02:01:28.666 --> 02:01:31.666
This is not the God I hope for.

1236
02:01:31.666 --> 02:01:33.666
This is not the God that...

1237
02:01:33.666 --> 02:01:36.666
The word I want to point out if you're taking notes,

1238
02:01:36.666 --> 02:01:40.666
is God is sovereign.

1239
02:01:40.666 --> 02:01:44.666
Important word for a Christian to learn.

1240
02:01:44.666 --> 02:01:47.666
Sovereign. God is sovereign.

1241
02:01:47.666 --> 02:01:50.666
How often have you heard the word sovereign? Not very often at all.

1242
02:01:50.666 --> 02:01:55.666
But it is such an important word for us as Christians to learn this word.

1243
02:01:55.666 --> 02:01:56.666
God is sovereign.

1244
02:01:56.666 --> 02:02:00.666
That means, God is everywhere,

1245
02:02:00.666 --> 02:02:02.666
and God can do everything,

1246
02:02:02.666 --> 02:02:04.666
God knows everything,

1247
02:02:04.666 --> 02:02:06.666
God is always,

1248
02:02:06.666 --> 02:02:08.666
God is almighty,

1249
02:02:08.666 --> 02:02:10.666
God has everything in His hand,

1250
02:02:10.666 --> 02:02:15.666
and absolutely nothing that happens on this earth,

1251
02:02:15.666 --> 02:02:18.666
escapes the attention of God.

1252
02:02:18.666 --> 02:02:23.666
And everything that happens is part of God's plan.

1253
02:02:24.666 --> 02:02:27.666
Just wait a moment Tim, what are you saying there?

1254
02:02:28.666 --> 02:02:35.666
Everything, absolutely everything, is part of what God has written.

1255
02:02:35.666 --> 02:02:42.666
Even the pain and the sorrow, even the things that are difficult for us to understand.

1256
02:02:42.666 --> 02:02:47.666
God has a plan, from Genesis to Revelation.

1257
02:02:47.666 --> 02:02:51.666
And everything that is in it is God's plan.

1258
02:02:51.666 --> 02:02:57.666
Now, does God have a plan to mistreat people? No.

1259
02:02:57.666 --> 02:03:02.666
Is it God's plan that children should die in wars? No.

1260
02:03:02.666 --> 02:03:06.666
But God is here and now.

1261
02:03:06.666 --> 02:03:10.666
And He is the God even in these situations.

1262
02:03:10.666 --> 02:03:13.666
And He is also present now.

1263
02:03:13.666 --> 02:03:19.666
And He sent His Son 2000 years ago for those situations.

1264
02:03:19.666 --> 02:03:23.666
And there will also come a day when Jesus will return,

1265
02:03:23.666 --> 02:03:26.666
to judge the living and the dead.

1266
02:03:26.666 --> 02:03:28.666
Yes, but why is God not doing anything about it now?

1267
02:03:28.666 --> 02:03:30.666
Children are dying in Gaza now,

1268
02:03:30.666 --> 02:03:32.666
children are dying in Syria now,

1269
02:03:32.666 --> 02:03:34.666
there is need now.

1270
02:03:34.666 --> 02:03:36.666
If God has to do something about it now,

1271
02:03:36.666 --> 02:03:39.666
based on what you think God should do about it now,

1272
02:03:39.666 --> 02:03:41.666
then that would be the last day.

1273
02:03:41.666 --> 02:03:43.666
For we have a just God.

1274
02:03:43.666 --> 02:03:46.666
And if God says, I will now kill those children in Gaza,

1275
02:03:46.666 --> 02:03:48.666
now, now stop,

1276
02:03:48.666 --> 02:03:51.666
then that is the last day, that is the return of Jesus.

1277
02:03:51.666 --> 02:03:54.666
And we believe that Jesus will return in this,

1278
02:03:54.666 --> 02:03:57.666
to put an end to all this pain,

1279
02:03:57.666 --> 02:04:00.666
to all this sorrow, to all this abuse.

1280
02:04:00.666 --> 02:04:03.666
God is doing something about it.

1281
02:04:03.666 --> 02:04:08.666
But let God do it in His way.

1282
02:04:08.666 --> 02:04:10.666
For God is a sovereign God.

1283
02:04:10.666 --> 02:04:12.666
And He knows what He is doing.

1284
02:04:12.666 --> 02:04:14.666
What we must do, dear people,

1285
02:04:14.666 --> 02:04:16.666
is have trust in God.

1286
02:04:16.666 --> 02:04:19.666
We must have trust in the love of God.

1287
02:04:19.666 --> 02:04:22.666
Shall we stand? I am going to close this service.

1288
02:04:22.666 --> 02:04:24.666
What we must do,

1289
02:04:24.666 --> 02:04:28.666
is have trust in the omnipotence of God.

1290
02:04:28.666 --> 02:04:31.666
That His plan is His will.

1291
02:04:31.666 --> 02:04:34.666
And His will be done in heaven and on earth.

1292
02:04:34.666 --> 02:04:36.666
Shall we close our eyes?

1293
02:04:36.666 --> 02:04:39.666
Have we learned something today, people?

1294
02:04:44.666 --> 02:04:47.666
Dear King Jesus, I thank You, Lord,

1295
02:04:47.666 --> 02:04:51.666
for Your love, Your power, Your love, Your wisdom,

1296
02:04:51.666 --> 02:04:53.666
Your truth, Lord.

1297
02:04:53.666 --> 02:04:55.666
Lord, I want to live according to Your Word.

1298
02:04:55.666 --> 02:04:59.666
And I want to live, Lord, according to what You have said from Your Word.

1299
02:04:59.666 --> 02:05:02.666
And I want to live, Lord, in obedience to Your Word.

1300
02:05:02.666 --> 02:05:05.666
Lord, I want to ask You to help us.

1301
02:05:05.666 --> 02:05:09.666
Lord, when we go through God's Word, through your Word,

1302
02:05:09.666 --> 02:05:13.666
may your Word correct us where we need correction.

1303
02:05:13.666 --> 02:05:15.666
Lord, may you also show us, Lord,

1304
02:05:15.666 --> 02:05:19.666
what you appreciate that we may do for you.

1305
02:05:19.666 --> 02:05:22.666
Our obedience to you shows us, Lord.

1306
02:05:22.666 --> 02:05:25.666
What you desire from us, every day again.

1307
02:05:25.666 --> 02:05:29.666
But Lord, let us also see through your Holy Spirit,

1308
02:05:29.666 --> 02:05:31.666
that if there are things in our lives

1309
02:05:31.666 --> 02:05:35.666
that keep us away from the love of God, the sin of Saul,

1310
02:05:35.666 --> 02:05:37.666
through jealousy,

1311
02:05:37.666 --> 02:05:43.666
or through a lack of trust in the ministry of the Lord,

1312
02:05:43.666 --> 02:05:45.666
or through pride, or through jealousy,

1313
02:05:45.666 --> 02:05:48.666
or through occultism, or such things.

1314
02:05:48.666 --> 02:05:53.666
Lord, help us to do what you say from your Word.

1315
02:05:53.666 --> 02:05:56.666
Lord, I want to ask you through your Holy Spirit.

1316
02:05:56.666 --> 02:05:58.666
Cleanse us, Lord.

1317
02:05:58.666 --> 02:06:02.666
Cleanse us in the areas, Lord, where we need cleansing.

1318
02:06:02.666 --> 02:06:05.666
Lord, show us, Lord, what you desire.

1319
02:06:05.666 --> 02:06:07.666
Lord, for we want to serve you.

1320
02:06:07.666 --> 02:06:09.666
We want to follow you, Jesus.

1321
02:06:09.666 --> 02:06:11.666
In the mighty name of Jesus.

1322
02:06:11.666 --> 02:06:12.666
Amen.

1323
02:06:12.666 --> 02:06:14.666
Amen, amen, amen.

1324
02:06:14.666 --> 02:06:15.666
People...

1325
02:06:15.666 --> 02:06:20.666
APPLAUSE

1326
02:06:20.666 --> 02:06:23.666
Nessie, prayer or not tomorrow?

1327
02:06:23.666 --> 02:06:25.666
Yes, prayer tomorrow.

1328
02:06:25.666 --> 02:06:27.666
Okay, I will close the service.

1329
02:06:27.666 --> 02:06:30.666
Let us close our eyes one more time and then I will close the service.

1330
02:06:30.666 --> 02:06:32.666
According to the prayer, hallelujah.

1331
02:06:32.666 --> 02:06:35.666
May the Lord bless you and protect you.

1332
02:06:35.666 --> 02:06:40.666
May the Lord make His face shine upon you and be gracious to you.

1333
02:06:40.666 --> 02:06:45.666
May the Lord turn His face toward you and give you peace.

1334
02:06:45.666 --> 02:06:48.666
Jesus, I want to ask you to be with us.

1335
02:06:48.666 --> 02:06:50.666
Every day of this week.

1336
02:06:50.666 --> 02:06:52.666
Lead us by your Holy Spirit,

1337
02:06:52.666 --> 02:06:55.666
so that we will always look to you.

1338
02:06:55.666 --> 02:06:57.666
In Jesus' mighty name.

1339
02:06:57.666 --> 02:06:58.666
Amen, amen.

1340
02:06:58.666 --> 02:07:00.666
Have a nice Sunday, people.
